# lagoon ps — real capture (run while `lagoon up` is live for the project)
Output assets/ps.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1100
Set Height 700
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/code/myapp"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "lagoon ps"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms

Screenshot assets/ps.png
Sleep 1s
